---
// src/pages/terms.astro — Terms & Conditions | AETHER Cyber-Minimalism
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="AETHER | TERMS OF SERVICE" description="Wannasingh Performance Systems technical network terms of service and usage protocols.">
  <div class="py-20 px-6 md:px-16 max-w-[800px] mx-auto reveal space-y-12">
    <header class="border-b border-[var(--outline-variant)]/30 pb-6">
      <p class="font-data-label text-xs text-[var(--secondary)] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">OPERATIONAL SYSTEM PROTOCOLS</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-[var(--primary)] uppercase leading-none mt-1">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="font-data-value text-xs text-[var(--outline)] mt-2">LAST REVISED: 2026.06.10 // SYSTEM_SECURE</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8 font-body-md text-sm text-[var(--on-surface-variant)] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-data-label text-xs uppercase text-[var(--primary)] font-bold">01. Network Enrollment</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing the Wannasingh private network and acquiring technical gear, you enroll in our performance monitoring system. All telemetry data returned from environmental sensors embedded in shells is private and encrypted under AES-256 protocols.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-data-label text-xs uppercase text-[var(--primary)] font-bold">02. Restoration Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          Our Lifetime Restoration Program applies strictly to authentic units bearing verifiable NFC signatures. Any tampering with fiber grids or modular sealing seams by unauthorized sectors will terminate restoration eligibility.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-data-label text-xs uppercase text-[var(--primary)] font-bold">03. Distribution Codes</h2>
        <p>
          Tactical drop products and prototypes are limited to level-certified collectors. Reselling drops on secondary public exchange nodes without logging transfer telemetry is discouraged.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
